From 79389ba2eb419ae520eaaf5f80ad91a1031b9c3a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yogesh Sevda <yogesh@example.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 21:01:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add bow splitting-arrow upgrade

Resolves #125.

Once upgraded, an attack fires three arrows instead of one - one
along the aim direction, plus one to each side at a 15 degree
spread. Each arrow spawns and checks its own path independently, so
a wall blocking the centre arrow does not stop the two side arrows.
Every arrow deals full, unscaled damage - the upgrade adds arrow
count, not damage.

Wired into the existing WeaponUpgradeComponent/UpgradeCommand
framework from #151 (upgrade bow / upgrade bow off).
